(2132464, 290765, 51638, '<td valign="top">Good capture but I''m not sure why you felt the need to tilt the image so much (the trees are a giveaway, as is the fact that no-one rides down a hill that steep on the aero bars and in the small chainring).</td>', 'Good capture but I''m not sure why you felt the need to tilt the image so much (the trees are a giveaway, as is the fact that no-one rides down a hill that steep on the aero bars and in the small chainring).', '2006-02-08 03:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
