(2132471, 292775, 51638, '<td valign="top">Yeah, this works!</td>', 'Yeah, this works!', '2006-02-08 03:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132472, 291409, 51638, '<td valign="top">I can''t really tell if this is motion panning or not.</td>', 'I can''t really tell if this is motion panning or not.', '2006-02-08 03:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132474, 291529, 51638, '<td valign="top">As a long time racer I''m a sucker for a good cycling shot and this is a good one. Focus on the rider''s face really draws the subject out of the background. Well done.</td>', 'As a long time racer I''m a sucker for a good cycling shot and this is a good one. Focus on the rider''s face really draws the subject out of the background. Well done.', '2006-02-08 03:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132480, 291370, 51638, '<td valign="top">Great job.</td>', 'Great job.', '2006-02-08 03:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132538, 292820, 42171, '<td valign="top">Awesome - I''m biased though as I am a petrol head...   :-)</td>', 'Awesome - I''m biased though as I am a petrol head...   :-)', '2006-02-08 03:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132554, 292040, 44607, '<td valign="top">Beautifull colors!!!!</td>', 'Beautifull colors!!!!', '2006-02-08 04:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132556, 291947, 44607, '<td valign="top">Perfect photo! but the motive is very usual..still very well done I think:-)</td>', 'Perfect photo! but the motive is very usual..still very well done I think:-)', '2006-02-08 04:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132557, 292336, 44607, '<td valign="top">Love it!!!!!!</td>', 'Love it!!!!!!', '2006-02-08 04:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132560, 292860, 44607, '<td valign="top">Beautifull;-)</td>', 'Beautifull;-)', '2006-02-08 04:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132591, 290097, 34938, '<td valign="top">what the heck is this...are you trying to be funny or annoying?</td>', 'what the heck is this...are you trying to be funny or annoying?', '2006-02-08 04:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132599, 292775, 52472, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the blured shadow of the skier. This takes away some of the speed sensation. The skier himself is impressively sharp, great shot!</td>', 'I don''t like the blured shadow of the skier. This takes away some of the speed sensation. The skier himself is impressively sharp, great shot!', '2006-02-08 04:30:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132613, 291947, 52472, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the unnatural angle of your picture, it takes away some of the speed sensation. The car is amazingly sharp, great shot!</td>', 'I don''t like the unnatural angle of your picture, it takes away some of the speed sensation. The car is amazingly sharp, great shot!', '2006-02-08 04:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132628, 290097, 2563, '<td valign="top">you''re the man!!!!!</td>', 'you''re the man!!!!!', '2006-02-08 04:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132643, 291951, 52472, '<td valign="top">The back ground looks to sharp, IMO. I would have used a slower shutter speed.</td>', 'The back ground looks to sharp, IMO. I would have used a slower shutter speed.', '2006-02-08 04:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132645, 290771, 52472, '<td valign="top">I know, it is difficult, but the subject is to blurred.</td>', 'I know, it is difficult, but the subject is to blurred.', '2006-02-08 04:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132650, 290541, 49109, '<td valign="top">no panning visible</td>', 'no panning visible', '2006-02-08 04:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132654, 292599, 49109, '<td valign="top">no panning visible</td>', 'no panning visible', '2006-02-08 04:59:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132656, 292240, 52472, '<td valign="top">Great picture! But as the subject was panning, I would have use a slightly lower shutter speed.</td>', 'Great picture! But as the subject was panning, I would have use a slightly lower shutter speed.', '2006-02-08 04:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132661, 292512, 48083, '<td valign="top">Does not give feeling of speed.</td>', 'Does not give feeling of speed.', '2006-02-08 05:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132669, 291066, 52472, '<td valign="top">This shot is very difficult. Nevertheless, the subject is not sharp enough, IMHO.</td>', 'This shot is very difficult. Nevertheless, the subject is not sharp enough, IMHO.', '2006-02-08 05:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132671, 290097, 52928, '<td valign="top">I have to say that I''m not seeing any motion panning here.  I have to admit that I am relatively new to using SLRs cameras, but I think that if you use a longer focal length when taking portraits (50mm-plus) you can flatten - and flatter - the features more.</td>', 'I have to say that I''m not seeing any motion panning here.  I have to admit that I am relatively new to using SLRs cameras, but I think that if you use a longer focal length when taking portraits (50mm-plus) you can flatten - and flatter - the features more.', '2006-02-08 05:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132673, 290541, 52472, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t see the panning...</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t see the panning...', '2006-02-08 05:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132678, 292599, 52472, '<td valign="top">It''s a pretty good picture, but I cant''t see the panning...</td>', 'It''s a pretty good picture, but I cant''t see the panning...', '2006-02-08 05:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132680, 292749, 52928, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo and it does include motion, but in my mind it does not "bring out the foreground" as a recognizable object.  It may be that your interpretation of the challenge is different from mine, but in not capturing the foreground it looks like the panning went wrong - too fast or too slow.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo and it does include motion, but in my mind it does not "bring out the foreground" as a recognizable object.  It may be that your interpretation of the challenge is different from mine, but in not capturing the foreground it looks like the panning went wrong - too fast or too slow.', '2006-02-08 05:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132686, 292870, 52928, '<td valign="top">A good capture. I would like to have seen more of the concentration on the face of the player in white and ideally the ball to be in sharp focus too.</td>', 'A good capture. I would like to have seen more of the concentration on the face of the player in white and ideally the ball to be in sharp focus too.', '2006-02-08 05:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132687, 290609, 52928, '<td valign="top">Great technique.  The train is pin-sharp.</td>', 'Great technique.  The train is pin-sharp.', '2006-02-08 05:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132705, 291305, 52928, '<td valign="top">Since it is in the sky the plane is clearly moving, but this looks like a shot taken at a fast shutter speed which has frozen the moment, rather than a motion panning shot.  I have to say that I''m not a great fan of the colouring either.</td>', 'Since it is in the sky the plane is clearly moving, but this looks like a shot taken at a fast shutter speed which has frozen the moment, rather than a motion panning shot.  I have to say that I''m not a great fan of the colouring either.', '2006-02-08 05:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132707, 292714, 52928, '<td valign="top">A good turn of speed from a three-legged horse - but it is just not sharp enough.</td>', 'A good turn of speed from a three-legged horse - but it is just not sharp enough.', '2006-02-08 05:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132708, 292614, 52928, '<td valign="top">The black vehicle appears to be in good focus - shame that we can''t see it all, ie composition could do with more work.</td>', 'The black vehicle appears to be in good focus - shame that we can''t see it all, ie composition could do with more work.', '2006-02-08 05:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132713, 292614, 48528, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I really don''t like the subject. Cars are too obvious for this contest</td>', 'Sorry, but I really don''t like the subject. Cars are too obvious for this contest', '2006-02-08 05:40:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132718, 292322, 52928, '<td valign="top">The fuschia buds at the front need to be sharper.</td>', 'The fuschia buds at the front need to be sharper.', '2006-02-08 05:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132719, 290135, 48528, '<td valign="top">Very cool.<br/>I know how it is difficult to catch people in motion panning. A human body is not so static as a car is. I love your interpretation. 9</td>', 'Very cool.I know how it is difficult to catch people in motion panning. A human body is not so static as a car is. I love your interpretation. 9', '2006-02-08 05:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132720, 290065, 48528, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this is not motion panning.</td>', 'Sorry, but this is not motion panning.', '2006-02-08 05:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132721, 290689, 52928, '<td valign="top">The train is sharp, so good technique, but I think the the lines in front-of the train spoil the image somewhat.</td>', 'The train is sharp, so good technique, but I think the the lines in front-of the train spoil the image somewhat.', '2006-02-08 05:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132722, 292599, 48528, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but where is motion panning?</td>', 'Sorry, but where is motion panning?', '2006-02-08 05:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132724, 292337, 48528, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting point of view. I think that cars are too obvious for motion panning, but your composition from a higher point of view give good personality to the picture.</td>', 'This is an interesting point of view. I think that cars are too obvious for motion panning, but your composition from a higher point of view give good personality to the picture.', '2006-02-08 05:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132725, 292870, 48528, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is a great shot! 9</td>', 'Wow, this is a great shot! 9', '2006-02-08 05:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132727, 291370, 48528, '<td valign="top">Don''t like too much the colors. But the composition is very cool.</td>', 'Don''t like too much the colors. But the composition is very cool.', '2006-02-08 05:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132729, 292821, 52928, '<td valign="top">A good effort at meeting the brief.  The runner could have been sharper and ideally more to the right in the shot to give them more room to run into.  Also perhaps if you had caught them on the opposite stride you might have got more of the expression on their face.</td>', 'A good effort at meeting the brief.  The runner could have been sharper and ideally more to the right in the shot to give them more room to run into.  Also perhaps if you had caught them on the opposite stride you might have got more of the expression on their face.', '2006-02-08 05:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132749, 292796, 52889, '<td valign="top">great photo almost like a painting</td>', 'great photo almost like a painting', '2006-02-08 06:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132750, 289925, 52889, '<td valign="top">love it great shot!</td>', 'love it great shot!', '2006-02-08 06:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132753, 292140, 52889, '<td valign="top">interesting quite scary lol good photo</td>', 'interesting quite scary lol good photo', '2006-02-08 06:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132755, 292870, 52889, '<td valign="top">what a shot great motion stop on the girls face</td>', 'what a shot great motion stop on the girls face', '2006-02-08 06:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132756, 290393, 52928, '<td valign="top">I would probably have said this was a "motion blur" shot, rather than a "motion panning" shot. Also, I would probably have entitled it "Fall" rather than "Jump" as they seem to be travelling down and this is where the space is.  While it is a stylish image, it is hard to tell whether it was a panning shot went wrong as the subject is not sharp, or it was supposed to be a motion blur shot - which is not really what was asked for.</td>', 'I would probably have said this was a "motion blur" shot, rather than a "motion panning" shot. Also, I would probably have entitled it "Fall" rather than "Jump" as they seem to be travelling down and this is where the space is.  While it is a stylish image, it is hard to tell whether it was a panning shot went wrong as the subject is not sharp, or it was supposed to be a motion blur shot - which is not really what was asked for.', '2006-02-08 06:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132757, 291434, 52889, '<td valign="top">like it alot what a capture</td>', 'like it alot what a capture', '2006-02-08 06:08:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132762, 291751, 49581, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I think the background is too much of the same to really emphasize the motion blur.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I think the background is too much of the same to really emphasize the motion blur.', '2006-02-08 06:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132764, 292812, 52889, '<td valign="top">really like it Chicken little is loving it!? made me laugh nice one</td>', 'really like it Chicken little is loving it!? made me laugh nice one', '2006-02-08 06:12:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132766, 290432, 52472, '<td valign="top">This is not panning... the coach should be sharp.</td>', 'This is not panning... the coach should be sharp.', '2006-02-08 06:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132777, 291606, 52928, '<td valign="top">Good sense of motion, though I would have liked to have seen the train a bit sharper.  I like the colour too.</td>', 'Good sense of motion, though I would have liked to have seen the train a bit sharper.  I like the colour too.', '2006-02-08 06:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132781, 292337, 52928, '<td valign="top">The car is sharp, so no complaints about technique.  I think the vantage point works for this photo and there is space for the car to move into.  The main negative for me is the tree in the foreground - I think the photo would have been a better composition without it.</td>', 'The car is sharp, so no complaints about technique.  I think the vantage point works for this photo and there is space for the car to move into.  The main negative for me is the tree in the foreground - I think the photo would have been a better composition without it.', '2006-02-08 06:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132784, 292749, 49581, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract, but I think to show the motion panning a subject is needed</td>', 'Nice abstract, but I think to show the motion panning a subject is needed', '2006-02-08 06:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132786, 292854, 47773, '<td valign="top">Beutiful idea</td>', 'Beutiful idea', '2006-02-08 06:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132791, 292796, 47773, '<td valign="top">nice shot</td>', 'nice shot', '2006-02-08 06:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132813, 292819, 49581, '<td valign="top">Lovely abstract, but I think a subject is needed for this challenge to show the panning.</td>', 'Lovely abstract, but I think a subject is needed for this challenge to show the panning.', '2006-02-08 06:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132819, 290135, 47773, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot</td>', 'beautiful shot', '2006-02-08 06:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132827, 291751, 52928, '<td valign="top">I like the spray but would have liked bike and rider to be sharper. Also, what''s the strange "tail" hanging off the bike?</td>', 'I like the spray but would have liked bike and rider to be sharper. Also, what''s the strange "tail" hanging off the bike?', '2006-02-08 06:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132841, 292756, 52928, '<td valign="top">Not such an interesting photo - would have looked better if it had been front of car and perhaps a bit closer in.  Car could have been a bit sharper.</td>', 'Not such an interesting photo - would have looked better if it had been front of car and perhaps a bit closer in.  Car could have been a bit sharper.', '2006-02-08 06:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132853, 292573, 52928, '<td valign="top">Plenty of movement and action, so good effort. Would have been better if nearest player had been sharper and ideally the ball too.  There are a couple of white lines that seem to cut across the frame - I suspect this must be a fence or something behind the pitch - detracts slightly.</td>', 'Plenty of movement and action, so good effort. Would have been better if nearest player had been sharper and ideally the ball too.  There are a couple of white lines that seem to cut across the frame - I suspect this must be a fence or something behind the pitch - detracts slightly.', '2006-02-08 06:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132856, 290065, 52928, '<td valign="top">There is certainly motion blur, but not really motion panning.</td>', 'There is certainly motion blur, but not really motion panning.', '2006-02-08 07:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132858, 292626, 52928, '<td valign="top">So, so close! Good action and framing. Just a shame that the panning didn''t quite come off and the expressions weren''t more in focus.</td>', 'So, so close! Good action and framing. Just a shame that the panning didn''t quite come off and the expressions weren''t more in focus.', '2006-02-08 07:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132877, 292852, 47117, '<td valign="top">This is so funny. I was going to enter this very same photo using my daughters Aussie Shephard, but I got just the face in perfect focus and all else was blurred. I was advised against it because of those factors, as it was really not motion panning. Due to this, I didn''t enter it.  I see yours unfortunately also has no real exact focus and pretty blurred.  I will give it a 5 though for effort and near exact of my own.  I entered broken instead. :)</td>', 'This is so funny. I was going to enter this very same photo using my daughters Aussie Shephard, but I got just the face in perfect focus and all else was blurred. I was advised against it because of those factors, as it was really not motion panning. Due to this, I didn''t enter it.  I see yours unfortunately also has no real exact focus and pretty blurred.  I will give it a 5 though for effort and near exact of my own.  I entered broken instead. :)', '2006-02-08 07:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132939, 292854, 25232, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2006-02-08 07:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132940, 290541, 25232, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2006-02-08 07:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132944, 292451, 25232, '<td valign="top">Got them brakes lock hard! Great shot.</td>', 'Got them brakes lock hard! Great shot.', '2006-02-08 07:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132945, 290432, 25232, '<td valign="top">Not really motion panning.</td>', 'Not really motion panning.', '2006-02-08 07:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132950, 290393, 25232, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2006-02-08 07:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132963, 292536, 25232, '<td valign="top">Nice poetic title. No motion panning.</td>', 'Nice poetic title. No motion panning.', '2006-02-08 07:37:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132966, 292749, 25232, '<td valign="top">Was supposed to go in Abstract?</td>', 'Was supposed to go in Abstract?', '2006-02-08 07:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132967, 291588, 52928, '<td valign="top">A good looking shot - reasonably sharp on the eagle.  Would have been better closer in and unfortunately the colourful items on the cliff underneath the bird take the attention away slightly</td>', 'A good looking shot - reasonably sharp on the eagle.  Would have been better closer in and unfortunately the colourful items on the cliff underneath the bird take the attention away slightly', '2006-02-08 07:39:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132981, 292819, 25232, '<td valign="top">You have to understand what the word "panning" means. I think you missed on this point.</td>', 'You have to understand what the word "panning" means. I think you missed on this point.', '2006-02-08 07:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132986, 290065, 25232, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2006-02-08 07:42:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132989, 290097, 25232, '<td valign="top">?</td>', '?', '2006-02-08 07:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132990, 292441, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, clear focus on the subject with the background blurred by the motion of panning the camera, just as requested by the challenge-Good luck</td>', 'Nicely done, clear focus on the subject with the background blurred by the motion of panning the camera, just as requested by the challenge-Good luck', '2006-02-08 07:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132992, 292889, 52928, '<td valign="top">Skater is sharp - shadows looks like skate tracks - not sure about cars in background though - kind of detract from the picture</td>', 'Skater is sharp - shadows looks like skate tracks - not sure about cars in background though - kind of detract from the picture', '2006-02-08 07:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2132996, 291529, 46468, '<td valign="top">Well done motion panning, good focus on the subject, definately motion blur to the background-good luck</td>', 'Well done motion panning, good focus on the subject, definately motion blur to the background-good luck', '2006-02-08 07:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133002, 291729, 47482, '<td valign="top">excellent idea and spot on shot!</td>', 'excellent idea and spot on shot!', '2006-02-08 07:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133004, 291067, 52928, '<td valign="top">Could have been sharper</td>', 'Could have been sharper', '2006-02-08 07:45:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133005, 292337, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on a colorful subject, however I do not see the motion blur to the background that motion panning requires</td>', 'Nice focus on a colorful subject, however I do not see the motion blur to the background that motion panning requires', '2006-02-08 07:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133006, 291237, 47482, '<td valign="top">this is a winner</td>', 'this is a winner', '2006-02-08 07:46:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133013, 291409, 52292, '<td valign="top">Looks like ballett. Well done</td>', 'Looks like ballett. Well done', '2006-02-08 07:46:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133016, 291453, 52292, '<td valign="top">Don''t see any motion panning... right?</td>', 'Don''t see any motion panning... right?', '2006-02-08 07:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133017, 291529, 52292, '<td valign="top">Wow, seems like stripes! Like it</td>', 'Wow, seems like stripes! Like it', '2006-02-08 07:47:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133018, 290920, 46468, '<td valign="top">Motion panning is suposed to be used to show the motion of the subject, with a sharp focus on the subject and a blur to the background caused by moving the camera, I just do not see that here</td>', 'Motion panning is suposed to be used to show the motion of the subject, with a sharp focus on the subject and a blur to the background caused by moving the camera, I just do not see that here', '2006-02-08 07:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133019, 291692, 47482, '<td valign="top">nice :)</td>', 'nice :)', '2006-02-08 07:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133020, 292756, 47482, '<td valign="top">very sharp!!</td>', 'very sharp!!', '2006-02-08 07:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133021, 292819, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and good effect of motion blur, but that, as far as I can tell, was not caused by motion panning.</td>', 'Nice composition and good effect of motion blur, but that, as far as I can tell, was not caused by motion panning.', '2006-02-08 07:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133023, 291920, 52928, '<td valign="top">Good vantage point, getting above the bird and eliminating any background distractions.  Good space for bird to fly into.  Bird looks sharp - would be keen to see a larger copy to see how sharp it really is.</td>', 'Good vantage point, getting above the bird and eliminating any background distractions.  Good space for bird to fly into.  Bird looks sharp - would be keen to see a larger copy to see how sharp it really is.', '2006-02-08 07:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133025, 292034, 46468, '<td valign="top">The front of the train appears to be in sharp focus, however I do not really see a blur to the background, or maybe it is a very slight bit of blur, but with the picture being so dark, I am having a tough time seeing enough detail to really judge the blur of the background which is what determines if panning has been used well</td>', 'The front of the train appears to be in sharp focus, however I do not really see a blur to the background, or maybe it is a very slight bit of blur, but with the picture being so dark, I am having a tough time seeing enough detail to really judge the blur of the background which is what determines if panning has been used well', '2006-02-08 07:50:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133026, 291037, 52928, '<td valign="top">Horse is sharp but would like to have seen more detail of face, especially around the eye - too dark</td>', 'Horse is sharp but would like to have seen more detail of face, especially around the eye - too dark', '2006-02-08 07:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133031, 291882, 52928, '<td valign="top">Based on a classic image, you''ve captured a good sense of motion and the horizon being slightly off doesn''t really detract from that.  Would liked to have seen taxi sharper.</td>', 'Based on a classic image, you''ve captured a good sense of motion and the horizon being slightly off doesn''t really detract from that.  Would liked to have seen taxi sharper.', '2006-02-08 07:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133033, 291453, 25355, '<td valign="top">Nice pic and all, but not for this challenge. What was the subject that you followed your camera with to created the effect of motion panning?</td>', 'Nice pic and all, but not for this challenge. What was the subject that you followed your camera with to created the effect of motion panning?', '2006-02-08 07:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133036, 290844, 46468, '<td valign="top">Nice stop action to the plane, however I am not really seeing or feeling the "panning" which suggests speed, seems more like a DOF blur to the background then motion blur, still a nice photo but IMO does not rate as high in this challenge as it would in a different challenge</td>', 'Nice stop action to the plane, however I am not really seeing or feeling the "panning" which suggests speed, seems more like a DOF blur to the background then motion blur, still a nice photo but IMO does not rate as high in this challenge as it would in a different challenge', '2006-02-08 07:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133038, 292240, 52928, '<td valign="top">Good capture.  Bird looks fairly in focus though perhaps the head is slightly less sharp - would be interesting to see larger vesion.</td>', 'Good capture.  Bird looks fairly in focus though perhaps the head is slightly less sharp - would be interesting to see larger vesion.', '2006-02-08 07:53:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2133043, 292240, 46468, '<td valign="top">Beautiful stop action on the pelican with a nice focus, however IMO the challenge to this challenge was to obtain a good background blur due to the action of following the subject with the camera, the background blur here seems to relate more to DOF issues then to motion panning</td>', 'Beautiful stop action on the pelican with a nice focus, however IMO the challenge to this challenge was to obtain a good background blur due to the action of following the subject with the camera, the background blur here seems to relate more to DOF issues then to motion panning', '2006-02-08 07:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133050, 290765, 25355, '<td valign="top">This is one of the few shots I''ve seen so far that have really nailed the motionn panningness required for the challenge. But I''m am far being a fan of such tiltedness. Why?</td>', 'This is one of the few shots I''ve seen so far that have really nailed the motionn panningness required for the challenge. But I''m am far being a fan of such tiltedness. Why?', '2006-02-08 07:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133074, 292854, 50251, '<td valign="top">Good one</td>', 'Good one', '2006-02-08 08:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133103, 290977, 52292, '<td valign="top">First I didn''t know if it''s good or not good for me. But now i think i like it =)</td>', 'First I didn''t know if it''s good or not good for me. But now i think i like it =)', '2006-02-08 08:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133105, 291947, 52292, '<td valign="top">It''s fantastic!</td>', 'It''s fantastic!', '2006-02-08 08:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133107, 292338, 44743, '<td valign="top">This shot is kind of neat-- though the girl is somewaht blurred, it gives the whole shot nice impressionistic feel.  Nice.</td>', 'This shot is kind of neat-- though the girl is somewaht blurred, it gives the whole shot nice impressionistic feel.  Nice.', '2006-02-08 08:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133111, 290646, 44743, '<td valign="top">It''s really hard to tell what I''m looking at in this shot.  Perhaps the reflections are a result of motion panning, but I really can''t tell what''s happening.</td>', 'It''s really hard to tell what I''m looking at in this shot.  Perhaps the reflections are a result of motion panning, but I really can''t tell what''s happening.', '2006-02-08 08:36:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133116, 292714, 44743, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.  The light, blurred background really makes the horse stand out.</td>', 'Nice capture.  The light, blurred background really makes the horse stand out.', '2006-02-08 08:38:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133120, 291951, 44743, '<td valign="top">The car is perfectly crisp, however, the background really isn''t "moving" very much with respect to the car.  You can see some movement in the wheel, but not too much.  I think this needed a longer shutter to make the motion more noticeable.</td>', 'The car is perfectly crisp, however, the background really isn''t "moving" very much with respect to the car.  You can see some movement in the wheel, but not too much.  I think this needed a longer shutter to make the motion more noticeable.', '2006-02-08 08:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133128, 291376, 52928, '<td valign="top">Motion blur, not motion panning</td>', 'Motion blur, not motion panning', '2006-02-08 08:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133129, 291047, 44743, '<td valign="top">A little less motion blur on the car would have helped this.</td>', 'A little less motion blur on the car would have helped this.', '2006-02-08 08:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133133, 291920, 44743, '<td valign="top">Wonderful shot.  The bird is perfectly crisp, while the background shows unmistakeable motion.</td>', 'Wonderful shot.  The bird is perfectly crisp, while the background shows unmistakeable motion.', '2006-02-08 08:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133135, 291453, 52928, '<td valign="top">Motion blur, not motion panning</td>', 'Motion blur, not motion panning', '2006-02-08 08:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133136, 292536, 52928, '<td valign="top">I don''t see evedince of panning</td>', 'I don''t see evedince of panning', '2006-02-08 08:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133141, 290254, 44743, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell which vehicle is the focal point.  The cars do appear more "stationary" against the moving background, but none of them is particularly crisp.  My guess is that this type of shot is very hard to do from so far away.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell which vehicle is the focal point.  The cars do appear more "stationary" against the moving background, but none of them is particularly crisp.  My guess is that this type of shot is very hard to do from so far away.', '2006-02-08 08:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133152, 292040, 52928, '<td valign="top">No evidence of panning technique</td>', 'No evidence of panning technique', '2006-02-08 08:50:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133157, 292451, 44743, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot.  Neat to see such motion in the road &amp; background, yet have the wheel at a complete stop.  The smoke from the wheel is a nice addition.  Wish the car was a bit closer to the bottom of the frame, but other than that, very nice.</td>', 'Very interesting shot.  Neat to see such motion in the road & background, yet have the wheel at a complete stop.  The smoke from the wheel is a nice addition.  Wish the car was a bit closer to the bottom of the frame, but other than that, very nice.', '2006-02-08 08:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133162, 292854, 44743, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  Great blur of the background.  The mid-air hair adds to the feel of motion.</td>', 'Nicely done!  Great blur of the background.  The mid-air hair adds to the feel of motion.', '2006-02-08 08:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133170, 291157, 44743, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like the nice, close crop &amp; the strong feel of motion.</td>', 'Great shot.  I like the nice, close crop & the strong feel of motion.', '2006-02-08 08:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133178, 291729, 44743, '<td valign="top">Clever / original idea for this challenge.  Nice blur of the background.  Just wish the purple balloon appeared as crisp as the red one does.</td>', 'Clever / original idea for this challenge.  Nice blur of the background.  Just wish the purple balloon appeared as crisp as the red one does.', '2006-02-08 08:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133181, 290432, 52928, '<td valign="top">The title says it all - motion blur, not motion panning</td>', 'The title says it all - motion blur, not motion panning', '2006-02-08 08:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133184, 290541, 52928, '<td valign="top">Looks like motion blur, not motion panning</td>', 'Looks like motion blur, not motion panning', '2006-02-08 08:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133185, 292860, 44743, '<td valign="top">It''s a very nice shot-- the bird certainly stands out from the background.  However, it seems that the background is much more a result of shallow DOF than of motion blur.</td>', 'It''s a very nice shot-- the bird certainly stands out from the background.  However, it seems that the background is much more a result of shallow DOF than of motion blur.', '2006-02-08 08:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133195, 291066, 44743, '<td valign="top">One of the most important parts of motion panning is to show movement of the subject against the background.  With a perfectly solid / white background, we have no way of seeing that the camera is following the ball.</td>', 'One of the most important parts of motion panning is to show movement of the subject against the background.  With a perfectly solid / white background, we have no way of seeing that the camera is following the ball.', '2006-02-08 09:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133213, 291588, 52472, '<td valign="top">A great picture. But as the subject was panning, I would have tried with a lower shutter speed.</td>', 'A great picture. But as the subject was panning, I would have tried with a lower shutter speed.', '2006-02-08 09:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133221, 291639, 52472, '<td valign="top">A great picture! But as the water surface is sharp, it does not really look like panning.</td>', 'A great picture! But as the water surface is sharp, it does not really look like panning.', '2006-02-08 09:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133230, 292852, 21714, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2006-02-08 09:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
