(2133266, 290135, 52091, '<td valign="top">That is a great photo! I love the angle. next time though eliminate a little more space. This photo met the challenge well.</td>', 'That is a great photo! I love the angle. next time though eliminate a little more space. This photo met the challenge well.', '2006-02-08 09:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
