(2133310, 291067, 48545, '<td valign="top">nice picture, caught the face well with concentration and pretty good focus.  I think the border is a bit exessive, I''d prefer to see more image than black border</td>', 'nice picture, caught the face well with concentration and pretty good focus.  I think the border is a bit exessive, I''d prefer to see more image than black border', '2006-02-08 09:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133315, 291639, 52091, '<td valign="top">Nice use of value, great composition.</td>', 'Nice use of value, great composition.', '2006-02-08 09:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133325, 290432, 52091, '<td valign="top">i love the movement on the bus.</td>', 'i love the movement on the bus.', '2006-02-08 09:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133329, 290106, 52091, '<td valign="top">Nice originality! Nice use of value.</td>', 'Nice originality! Nice use of value.', '2006-02-08 09:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133331, 292498, 52091, '<td valign="top">Your photo just look like it''s out of focus.</td>', 'Your photo just look like it''s out of focus.', '2006-02-08 09:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133337, 290097, 38549, '<td valign="top">to make this photograph better you need to add motion,</td>', 'to make this photograph better you need to add motion,', '2006-02-08 10:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133338, 290065, 52091, '<td valign="top">Nice originality! great use of value and sharpness.</td>', 'Nice originality! great use of value and sharpness.', '2006-02-08 10:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133343, 290765, 42506, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the angle here - not sure if it was in camera of after rotating / cropping but doesn''t matter - this is cool One of the best in the challenge so far.</td>', 'Great shot. Love the angle here - not sure if it was in camera of after rotating / cropping but doesn''t matter - this is cool One of the best in the challenge so far.', '2006-02-08 10:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133346, 292336, 31533, '<td valign="top">Nice one, the car is a bit underexposed though. Makes me dizzy, hehe.</td>', 'Nice one, the car is a bit underexposed though. Makes me dizzy, hehe.', '2006-02-08 10:07:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133348, 292854, 42506, '<td valign="top">One of the most creative shots in the challenge. Like this a lot</td>', 'One of the most creative shots in the challenge. Like this a lot', '2006-02-08 10:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133353, 291453, 31533, '<td valign="top">Are you sure you didn''t enter this image by mistake ?<br/>You may want to re-read the challenge description.</td>', 'Are you sure you didn''t enter this image by mistake ?You may want to re-read the challenge description.', '2006-02-08 10:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133354, 292337, 31533, '<td valign="top">Very nice color, pan is not extreme enough though. This image does not really portray ''motion'' to me.</td>', 'Very nice color, pan is not extreme enough though. This image does not really portray ''motion'' to me.', '2006-02-08 10:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133356, 291237, 42506, '<td valign="top">This is in my top 3. Excellent way to meet the challenge. Perfect focus and execution. Love the title and emotion also. 8</td>', 'This is in my top 3. Excellent way to meet the challenge. Perfect focus and execution. Love the title and emotion also. 8', '2006-02-08 10:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133359, 292040, 48545, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately there is nothing in focus anywhere so, this doesn''t meet the challenge.  As an abstract picture its not bad.</td>', 'Unfortunately there is nothing in focus anywhere so, this doesn''t meet the challenge.  As an abstract picture its not bad.', '2006-02-08 10:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133379, 290432, 48890, '<td valign="top">You didn''t pan the camera here.</td>', 'You didn''t pan the camera here.', '2006-02-08 10:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133383, 292812, 42506, '<td valign="top">lol - what a great interpretation. Is arguable as to whether this suggests motion but given the crop (showing the empty space in front of "him"), the surfboard like platform - it gets my vote. Great shot - giving this a 7.</td>', 'lol - what a great interpretation. Is arguable as to whether this suggests motion but given the crop (showing the empty space in front of "him"), the surfboard like platform - it gets my vote. Great shot - giving this a 7.', '2006-02-08 10:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133390, 291920, 42506, '<td valign="top">The best so far. One of the few who took the bull by the horns so to speak and went after a very challenging shot. I think you nailed this. More than any other image, it suggest SPEED! and movement. Great shot. You get a 9</td>', 'The best so far. One of the few who took the bull by the horns so to speak and went after a very challenging shot. I think you nailed this. More than any other image, it suggest SPEED! and movement. Great shot. You get a 9', '2006-02-08 10:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133397, 292536, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love that Lennon drawing. I have it hanging in the computer room.  NOt quite sure that shows what I''d consider motion .... Hmmmm</td>', 'Love that Lennon drawing. I have it hanging in the computer room.  NOt quite sure that shows what I''d consider motion .... Hmmmm', '2006-02-08 10:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133400, 292889, 15711, '<td valign="top">Heh I was just there. Maybe I passed you on the sidewalk!!!</td>', 'Heh I was just there. Maybe I passed you on the sidewalk!!!', '2006-02-08 10:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133401, 291729, 15711, '<td valign="top">Oh I love this.  The stripes of vertical color caused by the motion is wonderful. 9</td>', 'Oh I love this.  The stripes of vertical color caused by the motion is wonderful. 9', '2006-02-08 10:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133404, 292599, 15711, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the blur caused by the motion although it''s a great ski shot.</td>', 'I don''t see the blur caused by the motion although it''s a great ski shot.', '2006-02-08 10:34:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133406, 290135, 15711, '<td valign="top">NICE!!! I like the lines that the panning creates, behind her.  The red of her top really jumps out.  Her hair is great too. 9</td>', 'NICE!!! I like the lines that the panning creates, behind her.  The red of her top really jumps out.  Her hair is great too. 9', '2006-02-08 10:35:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133407, 291305, 15711, '<td valign="top">I am looking for the blur that motion panning creates and I''m not seeing it. Hmmmmm</td>', 'I am looking for the blur that motion panning creates and I''m not seeing it. Hmmmmm', '2006-02-08 10:36:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133409, 291692, 15711, '<td valign="top">NICE! Love the stripes of red. Bikes are such a wonderful shape with the lines and circles.  Good one. 9</td>', 'NICE! Love the stripes of red. Bikes are such a wonderful shape with the lines and circles.  Good one. 9', '2006-02-08 10:36:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133411, 292536, 48545, '<td valign="top">There is no background motion here, so no panning technique was used. Strange interesting image though</td>', 'There is no background motion here, so no panning technique was used. Strange interesting image though', '2006-02-08 10:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133415, 292337, 15711, '<td valign="top">I like the vivid sense of color.  Great clarity on the VW bug!! 8</td>', 'I like the vivid sense of color.  Great clarity on the VW bug!! 8', '2006-02-08 10:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133418, 291370, 15711, '<td valign="top">Excellent motion.  I love his sense of flying! I''d play with saturation and contrast. Maybe adjust levels to really richen up the tones.</td>', 'Excellent motion.  I love his sense of flying! I''d play with saturation and contrast. Maybe adjust levels to really richen up the tones.', '2006-02-08 10:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133419, 291434, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOW!!! Love the rich coloration and tack sharp dart.</td>', 'WOW!!! Love the rich coloration and tack sharp dart.', '2006-02-08 10:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133420, 290254, 15711, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see it in focus with everything else blurred.</td>', 'I''d like to see it in focus with everything else blurred.', '2006-02-08 10:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133427, 291453, 49696, '<td valign="top">Shots off a tripod are not considered panning, like the shot but not appropriate for this challenge</td>', 'Shots off a tripod are not considered panning, like the shot but not appropriate for this challenge', '2006-02-08 10:42:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133429, 291639, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love these guys!!! I wish he were a tad sharper, but overall, a nice image. 7</td>', 'I love these guys!!! I wish he were a tad sharper, but overall, a nice image. 7', '2006-02-08 10:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133435, 292403, 15711, '<td valign="top">I think it would be more effective if the cyclist were in focus a bit more. Love the vivid colors.</td>', 'I think it would be more effective if the cyclist were in focus a bit more. Love the vivid colors.', '2006-02-08 10:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133443, 290777, 15711, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the bike. The rich vibrant colors make this work.</td>', 'Nice focus on the bike. The rich vibrant colors make this work.', '2006-02-08 10:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133447, 292338, 15711, '<td valign="top">I wish she were more focused and the rest were blurred. I love the movement of her legs and the vivid blue of her dress.</td>', 'I wish she were more focused and the rest were blurred. I love the movement of her legs and the vivid blue of her dress.', '2006-02-08 10:52:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133450, 291066, 48545, '<td valign="top">because the background is almost white the sense of speed is lost in the photo therefore there isn''t a distinction between fore and background.  The knot lines make photo more interesting though.</td>', 'because the background is almost white the sense of speed is lost in the photo therefore there isn''t a distinction between fore and background.  The knot lines make photo more interesting though.', '2006-02-08 10:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133469, 292034, 48545, '<td valign="top">2 things I''d do differently.  Firstly the composition, either make the water a feature or the sky or crop into the train more.  The train is lost at the moment on a middle horizon.  Secondly, I''m starting to learn that the simpler the photo is the better.  There is too much going on here and the eye doesn''t know where to go.</td>', '2 things I''d do differently.  Firstly the composition, either make the water a feature or the sky or crop into the train more.  The train is lost at the moment on a middle horizon.  Secondly, I''m starting to learn that the simpler the photo is the better.  There is too much going on here and the eye doesn''t know where to go.', '2006-02-08 11:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133484, 292714, 33362, '<td valign="top">You have to clean that camera! Dust is everywhere. <br/> <br/>Too bad front leg is so hard to see. Good shot other than that.</td>', 'You have to clean that camera! Dust is everywhere.  Too bad front leg is so hard to see. Good shot other than that.', '2006-02-08 11:06:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2133498, 291947, 36881, '<td valign="top">joy! the first pic i''ve seen who understands this challenge...</td>', 'joy! the first pic i''ve seen who understands this challenge...', '2006-02-08 11:15:34.000000', NULL, 1),
