(2133983, 290432, 47704, '<td valign="top">Great pic. Does this meet the challenge though?  I''m not sure if motion panning mean the photographer has to move the camera or the object can move.  Oh well, I''m giving an 8 for this because it''s a cool pic anyway!!</td>', 'Great pic. Does this meet the challenge though?  I''m not sure if motion panning mean the photographer has to move the camera or the object can move.  Oh well, I''m giving an 8 for this because it''s a cool pic anyway!!', '2006-02-08 13:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
