(2134086, 292854, 48890, '<td valign="top">My favourite so far.  A very nice shot! 10<br/>Love the way the subject fills the frame, the suggestion of the motion, and the mood of this picture.  Just finished voting, and this remains my favourite in the challenge.</td>', 'My favourite so far.  A very nice shot! 10Love the way the subject fills the frame, the suggestion of the motion, and the mood of this picture.  Just finished voting, and this remains my favourite in the challenge.', '2006-02-08 13:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134101, 291434, 48890, '<td valign="top">Giving this an 7 for the technical merit: the dart is extremely sharp, especially considering this is a panning shot.  As a composition, I don''t think this is an interesting picture, though.</td>', 'Giving this an 7 for the technical merit: the dart is extremely sharp, especially considering this is a panning shot.  As a composition, I don''t think this is an interesting picture, though.', '2006-02-08 13:59:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134126, 291434, 52928, '<td valign="top">I''m intrigued as to how this was done, as it would require an amazing ability to capture the dart so perfectly using a normal panning technique.  I''m giving it the benefit of the doubt. Well done.</td>', 'I''m intrigued as to how this was done, as it would require an amazing ability to capture the dart so perfectly using a normal panning technique.  I''m giving it the benefit of the doubt. Well done.', '2006-02-08 14:03:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134132, 290097, 51802, '<td valign="top">I think you are trying to make some kind of statement, but I am not getting it.</td>', 'I think you are trying to make some kind of statement, but I am not getting it.', '2006-02-08 14:04:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134144, 291639, 52928, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing picture.  I am a little surprised at the colour of the penguin and would have been tempted to crop out the white "thing" at the top.  But full marks for technique.</td>', 'This is an amazing picture.  I am a little surprised at the colour of the penguin and would have been tempted to crop out the white "thing" at the top.  But full marks for technique.', '2006-02-08 14:06:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134151, 290668, 52928, '<td valign="top">Beatifully sharp ball/marble/orb. Good highlights and colour. Intriguing.</td>', 'Beatifully sharp ball/marble/orb. Good highlights and colour. Intriguing.', '2006-02-08 14:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134154, 292536, 51802, '<td valign="top">The background is much too sharp for panning motion.  A slower shutter speed would help.</td>', 'The background is much too sharp for panning motion.  A slower shutter speed would help.', '2006-02-08 14:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134161, 290393, 51802, '<td valign="top">A little bit faster shutter speed might have helped improve the sharpness enought to more easily tell this is a person.</td>', 'A little bit faster shutter speed might have helped improve the sharpness enought to more easily tell this is a person.', '2006-02-08 14:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134173, 290920, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of the moment.  However, it seems more like camera movement with sharpness from flash, rather than tracking of the subject.  For motion panning, don''t use your flash.  Using flash will freeze an instant and you will loose the separation of the subject from the motion-blurred background.</td>', 'Nice capture of the moment.  However, it seems more like camera movement with sharpness from flash, rather than tracking of the subject.  For motion panning, don''t use your flash.  Using flash will freeze an instant and you will loose the separation of the subject from the motion-blurred background.', '2006-02-08 14:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134175, 292134, 52928, '<td valign="top">I started at the beginning of the challenge entries and when I arrived at this photo I thought ... good focus, great action, excellent technique.  A couple of things brought it down for me, though ...<br/> <br/>1. the dark object in the bottom right corner looks like it might have been the top of someone''s head; I suppose cropping this out would have reduced the impact of the cars being jumped.<br/> <br/>2. there appears to be a distinctive blue cast to the image.  Having looked at the other entries I don''t think it''s my monitor, but wouldn''t swear to it.</td>', 'I started at the beginning of the challenge entries and when I arrived at this photo I thought ... good focus, great action, excellent technique.  A couple of things brought it down for me, though ... 1. the dark object in the bottom right corner looks like it might have been the top of someone''s head; I suppose cropping this out would have reduced the impact of the cars being jumped. 2. there appears to be a distinctive blue cast to the image.  Having looked at the other entries I don''t think it''s my monitor, but wouldn''t swear to it.', '2006-02-08 14:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134185, 291639, 51802, '<td valign="top">Subject has great sharpness, but the background does not convey the "motion" of the shot.  Only the bubbles indicate this.</td>', 'Subject has great sharpness, but the background does not convey the "motion" of the shot.  Only the bubbles indicate this.', '2006-02-08 14:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134186, 292724, 52928, '<td valign="top">The panning is not quite right and as a result the bird is out of focus.</td>', 'The panning is not quite right and as a result the bird is out of focus.', '2006-02-08 14:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134187, 292812, 52928, '<td valign="top">A fun photograph, but does not look like a panning shot.  All I can think is that the camera and figure are physically fixed relative to each other and are moving together or the background is moving around them.  I don''t see this an example of panning the camera relative to the main item in the photograph.</td>', 'A fun photograph, but does not look like a panning shot.  All I can think is that the camera and figure are physically fixed relative to each other and are moving together or the background is moving around them.  I don''t see this an example of panning the camera relative to the main item in the photograph.', '2006-02-08 14:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134188, 292140, 52928, '<td valign="top">Similar to a few others this does not appear to be a panning shot intended to capture an moving object relative to the camera.</td>', 'Similar to a few others this does not appear to be a panning shot intended to capture an moving object relative to the camera.', '2006-02-08 14:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134189, 292819, 52928, '<td valign="top">Looks more like motion blur than a motion panning shot.</td>', 'Looks more like motion blur than a motion panning shot.', '2006-02-08 14:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134192, 291951, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness.  Shutter speed is probably too high for background blur to show that you met the motion panning challenge.</td>', 'Nice sharpness.  Shutter speed is probably too high for background blur to show that you met the motion panning challenge.', '2006-02-08 14:16:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134195, 290604, 52928, '<td valign="top">The panning does not appear to have worked very well here. The horse is too out of focus.</td>', 'The panning does not appear to have worked very well here. The horse is too out of focus.', '2006-02-08 14:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134199, 292512, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness and color.  Shutter speed is probably too high for background blur to show that you met the motion panning challenge.</td>', 'Nice sharpness and color.  Shutter speed is probably too high for background blur to show that you met the motion panning challenge.', '2006-02-08 14:16:45.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2134202, 292599, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Shutter speed is probably too high for background blur to show that you met the motion panning challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Shutter speed is probably too high for background blur to show that you met the motion panning challenge.', '2006-02-08 14:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134204, 292403, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Pretty good attempt at a difficult challenge.  Would be better if subject were sharper, try matching the motion more exactly and/or slightly faster shutter speed.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Pretty good attempt at a difficult challenge.  Would be better if subject were sharper, try matching the motion more exactly and/or slightly faster shutter speed.', '2006-02-08 14:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134206, 291332, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and expression.  Pretty good attempt at a difficult challenge.  Would be better if subject were sharper, try matching the motion more exactly and/or slightly faster shutter speed.</td>', 'Nice idea and expression.  Pretty good attempt at a difficult challenge.  Would be better if subject were sharper, try matching the motion more exactly and/or slightly faster shutter speed.', '2006-02-08 14:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134210, 290432, 51802, '<td valign="top">It is hard to tell that you panned the camera for this shot.</td>', 'It is hard to tell that you panned the camera for this shot.', '2006-02-08 14:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134211, 291690, 44490, '<td valign="top">Pretty good attempt at a difficult challenge.  Would be better if subject were sharper, try matching the motion more exactly and/or slightly faster shutter speed.</td>', 'Pretty good attempt at a difficult challenge.  Would be better if subject were sharper, try matching the motion more exactly and/or slightly faster shutter speed.', '2006-02-08 14:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134214, 290646, 52928, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what to say about this one.  It almost looks like the picture is being taken through a reflection on glass but the sheer effort of trying to work out what is going on here is detracting my attention away from the image itself.  I''m afraid I don''t find it terribly engaging.</td>', 'Not really sure what to say about this one.  It almost looks like the picture is being taken through a reflection on glass but the sheer effort of trying to work out what is going on here is detracting my attention away from the image itself.  I''m afraid I don''t find it terribly engaging.', '2006-02-08 14:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134216, 291376, 51802, '<td valign="top">The blur at the top of the can seems to conflict with the blur at the bottom.  It is hard for me to tell which way the motion is.</td>', 'The blur at the top of the can seems to conflict with the blur at the bottom.  It is hard for me to tell which way the motion is.', '2006-02-08 14:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134220, 292498, 52928, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure in what sense this is motion panning. It appears to be more of a motion blur shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure in what sense this is motion panning. It appears to be more of a motion blur shot.', '2006-02-08 14:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134223, 290580, 51802, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I think this is exactly what the challenge was looking for!</td>', 'Great shot!  I think this is exactly what the challenge was looking for!', '2006-02-08 14:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134226, 292727, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  But it looks like a long exposure with subject motion frozen by flash rather than proper motion panning by tracking a moving subject with a long enough exposure to motion blur the background.</td>', 'Nice idea.  But it looks like a long exposure with subject motion frozen by flash rather than proper motion panning by tracking a moving subject with a long enough exposure to motion blur the background.', '2006-02-08 14:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134227, 291729, 29293, '<td valign="top">vertical panning, good!</td>', 'vertical panning, good!', '2006-02-08 14:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134228, 290254, 52928, '<td valign="top">The panning does not appear to have really worked here.  It would have been better if more of the vehicles were sharper - though I imagine that if they''re all travelling at different speeds that would be tricky!</td>', 'The panning does not appear to have really worked here.  It would have been better if more of the vehicles were sharper - though I imagine that if they''re all travelling at different speeds that would be tricky!', '2006-02-08 14:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134229, 292451, 51802, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The timing is perfect.</td>', 'Great shot!  The timing is perfect.', '2006-02-08 14:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
