(2134331, 292854, 52928, '<td valign="top">You seem to have captured a lot of movement in this photo.  The face may be a little out of focus - its hard to tell at this size. I would have been interested to see a version with more of the girl in it, i.e. perhaps the crop is a little too tight, and hand covering part of the face is unfortunate.  Still good techinque though</td>', 'You seem to have captured a lot of movement in this photo.  The face may be a little out of focus - its hard to tell at this size. I would have been interested to see a version with more of the girl in it, i.e. perhaps the crop is a little too tight, and hand covering part of the face is unfortunate.  Still good techinque though', '2006-02-08 14:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
