(2134420, 292434, 44490, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect.  Would be better if you were following a subject in motion to get motion blur separation from the background, not shooting while in motion at a stationary subject.  Would be better without the obstructions of the mirror, etc.</td>', 'Interesting effect.  Would be better if you were following a subject in motion to get motion blur separation from the background, not shooting while in motion at a stationary subject.  Would be better without the obstructions of the mirror, etc.', '2006-02-08 14:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
