(2134919, 292568, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  But it''s just too difficult to figure out what is going on here.  I sharper and larger subject in motion would be better.</td>', 'Nice colors.  But it''s just too difficult to figure out what is going on here.  I sharper and larger subject in motion would be better.', '2006-02-08 17:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134927, 291588, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice bald eagle shot.  However background blur seems to be more from DOF than from motion panning.  A slower shutter speed and clearer demonstration of motion panning effect would fit the challenge better.</td>', 'Nice bald eagle shot.  However background blur seems to be more from DOF than from motion panning.  A slower shutter speed and clearer demonstration of motion panning effect would fit the challenge better.', '2006-02-08 17:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134934, 291639, 44490, '<td valign="top">Wonderful penguin shot. However this image doesn''t show evidence of motion panning effect, which would be better to fit the challenge.  Try a slower shutter speed.  I still love the image.</td>', 'Wonderful penguin shot. However this image doesn''t show evidence of motion panning effect, which would be better to fit the challenge.  Try a slower shutter speed.  I still love the image.', '2006-02-08 17:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134945, 291037, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, nice coloring of the horse.  Background blur seems to be more from DOF than from motion panning.  A longer exposure with more panning motion blur would fit the challenge better.</td>', 'Nice composition, nice coloring of the horse.  Background blur seems to be more from DOF than from motion panning.  A longer exposure with more panning motion blur would fit the challenge better.', '2006-02-08 17:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134962, 290604, 44490, '<td valign="top">Pretty good meeting of a difficult challenge.  Too bad Duke moved his head so much.</td>', 'Pretty good meeting of a difficult challenge.  Too bad Duke moved his head so much.', '2006-02-08 18:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134972, 291434, 44490, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and composition.  Looks like background blur is due more to DOF than to (minimal?) motion panning.  A slower shutter speed would allow for motion blurring of the background to be made more evident by longer streaks.</td>', 'Nice colors and composition.  Looks like background blur is due more to DOF than to (minimal?) motion panning.  A slower shutter speed would allow for motion blurring of the background to be made more evident by longer streaks.', '2006-02-08 18:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2134973, 291047, 44490, '<td valign="top">Pretty good attempt at a difficult challenge.  Would be better if subject were sharper, try matching the motion more exactly or slightly faster shutter speed.</td>', 'Pretty good attempt at a difficult challenge.  Would be better if subject were sharper, try matching the motion more exactly or slightly faster shutter speed.', '2006-02-08 18:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
