(2135209, 292748, 1647, '<td valign="top">You have what look like major dust specks in this shot, near the top and on the left (also one on the front wheel of the bike).  If they are in every shot you''ll need to get the camera cleaned.  Other than that it''s a pretty good attempt at panning.  It''s a shame it wasn''t a sunny day.</td>', 'You have what look like major dust specks in this shot, near the top and on the left (also one on the front wheel of the bike).  If they are in every shot you''ll need to get the camera cleaned.  Other than that it''s a pretty good attempt at panning.  It''s a shame it wasn''t a sunny day.', '2006-02-08 19:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
