(2135942, 291434, 46336, '<td valign="top">I''m struggling to vote for this one. it''s one of my favourite shot in the challenge, but I struggle to believe it was achived with motion panning. That said, many photographers are capable of achiving things I wouldn''t even know how to do. I''ll try to remember to look this up after the challenge.</td>', 'I''m struggling to vote for this one. it''s one of my favourite shot in the challenge, but I struggle to believe it was achived with motion panning. That said, many photographers are capable of achiving things I wouldn''t even know how to do. I''ll try to remember to look this up after the challenge.', '2006-02-09 01:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135948, 290097, 47151, '<td valign="top">Well now that nokia is getting a work out isn''t it</td>', 'Well now that nokia is getting a work out isn''t it', '2006-02-09 01:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135962, 292852, 47487, '<td valign="top">nice choice of subject!</td>', 'nice choice of subject!', '2006-02-09 01:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135966, 292042, 47487, '<td valign="top">Good job with the panning on the stroller. I know you can''t control this sort of thing, but wouldn''t it just have been fabulous if the baby had been sitting up peering around the edge of the stroller? :) Great shot.</td>', 'Good job with the panning on the stroller. I know you can''t control this sort of thing, but wouldn''t it just have been fabulous if the baby had been sitting up peering around the edge of the stroller? :) Great shot.', '2006-02-09 01:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135968, 292550, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice balance -- the background is good and blurred to show the motion, yet the dog''s legs are relatively sharp. I know how hard that is. :)</td>', 'Nice balance -- the background is good and blurred to show the motion, yet the dog''s legs are relatively sharp. I know how hard that is. :)', '2006-02-09 01:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135969, 291882, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, too bad the rear of the taxi was cut off. Still, good job with the panning.</td>', 'Oh, too bad the rear of the taxi was cut off. Still, good job with the panning.', '2006-02-09 01:53:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135971, 290254, 47487, '<td valign="top">This is a nice vantage point for a picture. Unfortunately, though, there''s nothing really clear enough in the photo to capture the motion sharply.</td>', 'This is a nice vantage point for a picture. Unfortunately, though, there''s nothing really clear enough in the photo to capture the motion sharply.', '2006-02-09 01:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135974, 291991, 47487, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot! Nice colors. I personally am not crazy about extreme tilts, but I respect your right to make that artistic decision yourself. :)</td>', 'Interesting shot! Nice colors. I personally am not crazy about extreme tilts, but I respect your right to make that artistic decision yourself. :)', '2006-02-09 01:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135975, 290580, 47487, '<td valign="top">Textbook example of motion panning. Well-done.</td>', 'Textbook example of motion panning. Well-done.', '2006-02-09 01:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135976, 291453, 18870, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, but it doesn''t fit for this challenge.</td>', 'very nice photo, but it doesn''t fit for this challenge.', '2006-02-09 01:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135977, 292819, 47487, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, you didn''t pan along with anything in this photo. There''s no focal point, no subject, and nothing sharp. The light is pretty, though.</td>', 'Unfortunately, you didn''t pan along with anything in this photo. There''s no focal point, no subject, and nothing sharp. The light is pretty, though.', '2006-02-09 01:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135978, 291283, 47487, '<td valign="top">Oh, nicely done. The expression, the motion, the blues, the busy background, everything works together to make this a really good shot.</td>', 'Oh, nicely done. The expression, the motion, the blues, the busy background, everything works together to make this a really good shot.', '2006-02-09 01:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135979, 292821, 47487, '<td valign="top">The yellows in the background really add to this, I think. Good job.</td>', 'The yellows in the background really add to this, I think. Good job.', '2006-02-09 01:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135983, 290135, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice one! Kids on swings are my favorite subject on whom to practice this technique, and you did a great job here. The colors (even to the chains on the swing) are really nice, and not only the blur but also her hair do a great job of showing the motion. Perhaps a very slightly tighter crop, do you think?</td>', 'Nice one! Kids on swings are my favorite subject on whom to practice this technique, and you did a great job here. The colors (even to the chains on the swing) are really nice, and not only the blur but also her hair do a great job of showing the motion. Perhaps a very slightly tighter crop, do you think?', '2006-02-09 01:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135984, 292631, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2006-02-09 01:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135987, 291376, 47487, '<td valign="top">"Panning" involves moving the camera to keep up with a moving subject. I see what you were going for here, and you did a decent job at that, but for this challenge, it doesn''t work.</td>', '"Panning" involves moving the camera to keep up with a moving subject. I see what you were going for here, and you did a decent job at that, but for this challenge, it doesn''t work.', '2006-02-09 02:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135988, 290844, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp. Good job.</td>', 'Nice and sharp. Good job.', '2006-02-09 02:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135989, 292756, 47487, '<td valign="top">A little blown in the highlights, and the subject could have been sharper. Nice try, though, and the background provides a lot of interest.</td>', 'A little blown in the highlights, and the subject could have been sharper. Nice try, though, and the background provides a lot of interest.', '2006-02-09 02:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135990, 291751, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice touch with the reflection. Seems like the motorcycle maybe should have been just the TINIEST bit sharper for maximum effect. Still, a good job.</td>', 'Nice touch with the reflection. Seems like the motorcycle maybe should have been just the TINIEST bit sharper for maximum effect. Still, a good job.', '2006-02-09 02:03:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135992, 290065, 42984, '<td valign="top">Great motion blur but not panning motion - what a pity coz this is worth heaps as a photo</td>', 'Great motion blur but not panning motion - what a pity coz this is worth heaps as a photo', '2006-02-09 02:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135993, 291994, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice choice of subject. It''s hard to avoid blowing highlights at the slow shutter speeds needed for this type of effect, especially if there''s going to be any nice bright color in the photo at all. I''d like to have seen the bird''s feet, too, but I know that with wildlife you usually just have to take what you get and be glad of it. :)</td>', 'Nice choice of subject. It''s hard to avoid blowing highlights at the slow shutter speeds needed for this type of effect, especially if there''s going to be any nice bright color in the photo at all. I''d like to have seen the bird''s feet, too, but I know that with wildlife you usually just have to take what you get and be glad of it. :)', '2006-02-09 02:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135995, 292434, 47487, '<td valign="top">This good job of panning is lost in a photo that has too many distractions (mainly the interior of the car you were in when you took it).</td>', 'This good job of panning is lost in a photo that has too many distractions (mainly the interior of the car you were in when you took it).', '2006-02-09 02:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135996, 290432, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice blur, but no panning involved. As a photo in general, I like this, and would have liked it even better if the white balance had been properly adjusted to avoid the yellow cast.</td>', 'Nice blur, but no panning involved. As a photo in general, I like this, and would have liked it even better if the white balance had been properly adjusted to avoid the yellow cast.', '2006-02-09 02:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135998, 291047, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nicely done; I like the b/w.</td>', 'Nicely done; I like the b/w.', '2006-02-09 02:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2135999, 290541, 47487, '<td valign="top">I... don''t see panning.?</td>', 'I... don''t see panning.?', '2006-02-09 02:07:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136001, 292739, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice panning, and a very cute subject. :) I love ducks.</td>', 'Nice panning, and a very cute subject. :) I love ducks.', '2006-02-09 02:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136002, 292451, 47487, '<td valign="top">Ooh, GOOD subject choice, and an excellent job panning also. I wish we could see the back of the car, but it''s an interesting composition without it as well.</td>', 'Ooh, GOOD subject choice, and an excellent job panning also. I wish we could see the back of the car, but it''s an interesting composition without it as well.', '2006-02-09 02:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136004, 291951, 47487, '<td valign="top">If there''s any motion blur in this photo it''s so slight that I can''t detect it, other than in the wheels of the car. Also, the highlights in the snow are blown. Maybe a tighter aperture and a slower shutter speed would have helped. If that''s as small as your aperture will go, maybe try a neutral density filter?</td>', 'If there''s any motion blur in this photo it''s so slight that I can''t detect it, other than in the wheels of the car. Also, the highlights in the snow are blown. Maybe a tighter aperture and a slower shutter speed would have helped. If that''s as small as your aperture will go, maybe try a neutral density filter?', '2006-02-09 02:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136005, 291157, 47487, '<td valign="top">Ooh. Interesting, eye-catching subject; great blur/sharpness. Nicely done.</td>', 'Ooh. Interesting, eye-catching subject; great blur/sharpness. Nicely done.', '2006-02-09 02:10:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136006, 292502, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice twilight colors; excellent job panning.</td>', 'Nice twilight colors; excellent job panning.', '2006-02-09 02:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136007, 292322, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nothing is sharp here. I do see the wind effect you''re going for, but the idea with motion panning is that one subject will stand out and be sharp. I like the colors, though.</td>', 'Nothing is sharp here. I do see the wind effect you''re going for, but the idea with motion panning is that one subject will stand out and be sharp. I like the colors, though.', '2006-02-09 02:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136008, 290668, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice! Even though it kind of makes my head swim to look at it too long. :)</td>', 'Nice! Even though it kind of makes my head swim to look at it too long. :)', '2006-02-09 02:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136035, 291519, 46336, '<td valign="top">I''ve thought a lot about this shot. It looks incredible. The focus is almost too sharp given the challenge. Still, just because I couldn''t do it doesn''t mean it''s not possible. There are enough streaks for me to be inclinded to give you the benefit of the doubt. I''ll try to remember to check this after the challenge.</td>', 'I''ve thought a lot about this shot. It looks incredible. The focus is almost too sharp given the challenge. Still, just because I couldn''t do it doesn''t mean it''s not possible. There are enough streaks for me to be inclinded to give you the benefit of the doubt. I''ll try to remember to check this after the challenge.', '2006-02-09 02:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136052, 291453, 18073, '<td valign="top">doesn''t meet the challenge</td>', 'doesn''t meet the challenge', '2006-02-09 03:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136053, 292819, 18073, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t meet the challenge</td>', 'Doesn''t meet the challenge', '2006-02-09 03:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136054, 292512, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice composure but there is a distinct lack of blur here, you have almost frozen the action rather than use a panning technique</td>', 'Nice composure but there is a distinct lack of blur here, you have almost frozen the action rather than use a panning technique', '2006-02-09 03:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136056, 291947, 18073, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  Great sharpness on the car and I like the dynamic angle you have shot at.  Perhaps would have cropped off the bottom of the image to remove the grass verge and get you a bit tighter on the car.<br/> <br/>One of the better panning images in the challenge though</td>', 'Nice shot.  Great sharpness on the car and I like the dynamic angle you have shot at.  Perhaps would have cropped off the bottom of the image to remove the grass verge and get you a bit tighter on the car. One of the better panning images in the challenge though', '2006-02-09 03:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136057, 290432, 18073, '<td valign="top">doesn''t meet the challenge!</td>', 'doesn''t meet the challenge!', '2006-02-09 03:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136076, 291237, 52578, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Looks a bit over-saturated on my screen though, and a bit more of the bike(wheels) in the frame would''ve added to the picture imo.</td>', 'Very cool. Looks a bit over-saturated on my screen though, and a bit more of the bike(wheels) in the frame would''ve added to the picture imo.', '2006-02-09 04:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136183, 292852, 14603, '<td valign="top">Refreshing to find an image that illustrates the concept of motion panning as opposed to motion blur...and a good one at that.<br/>Nicely done.</td>', 'Refreshing to find an image that illustrates the concept of motion panning as opposed to motion blur...and a good one at that.Nicely done.', '2006-02-09 06:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136189, 292870, 14603, '<td valign="top">I think you got this just right. The shutterspeed has captured the main subject but also allowed enough blurring to give the feeling of action and speed.<br/>Well done &amp; good luck</td>', 'I think you got this just right. The shutterspeed has captured the main subject but also allowed enough blurring to give the feeling of action and speed.Well done & good luck', '2006-02-09 06:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136192, 292631, 52578, '<td valign="top">Wicked shot, just wished there would be some part that''s a bit sharper, but understandably difficult.</td>', 'Wicked shot, just wished there would be some part that''s a bit sharper, but understandably difficult.', '2006-02-09 06:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136193, 291067, 14603, '<td valign="top">A fine example of motion panning unlike so many other images in this challenge.</td>', 'A fine example of motion panning unlike so many other images in this challenge.', '2006-02-09 06:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136204, 292140, 49109, '<td valign="top">very creative, try it again with a smile ;)</td>', 'very creative, try it again with a smile ;)', '2006-02-09 06:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136205, 292134, 49109, '<td valign="top">check your white balance, it is too blue</td>', 'check your white balance, it is too blue', '2006-02-09 06:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136209, 291370, 14603, '<td valign="top">You probably couldn`t have chosen a more difficult subject to try capturing the blur of motion panning as you also have to try to stop action (unlike birds gliding etc).<br/>Essential that your shutterspeed is just right and you`ve achieved that well here.<br/>Good work.</td>', 'You probably couldn`t have chosen a more difficult subject to try capturing the blur of motion panning as you also have to try to stop action (unlike birds gliding etc).Essential that your shutterspeed is just right and you`ve achieved that well here.Good work.', '2006-02-09 07:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136212, 292854, 38032, '<td valign="top">this is my favorite - the detail is so perfect and the blur is so exagerated - really great idea too.  I love the look on the model''s face and everything  A rare 10 from me.</td>', 'this is my favorite - the detail is so perfect and the blur is so exagerated - really great idea too.  I love the look on the model''s face and everything  A rare 10 from me.', '2006-02-09 07:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136213, 292573, 38032, '<td valign="top">He looks out of bounds - not that he is - it just looks like that.  Anyway- this definitely shows nice motionand I can see the blurred expression on the guy in the background.  cool. 6</td>', 'He looks out of bounds - not that he is - it just looks like that.  Anyway- this definitely shows nice motionand I can see the blurred expression on the guy in the background.  cool. 6', '2006-02-09 07:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136216, 290432, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is cool - it definitely gives the feeling of confinement and movement ... but you may get some "dnmc" - it appears that the train is moving, not the camera.</td>', 'This is cool - it definitely gives the feeling of confinement and movement ... but you may get some "dnmc" - it appears that the train is moving, not the camera.', '2006-02-09 07:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136218, 291434, 38032, '<td valign="top">how many takes?  that''s perfectly crisp.</td>', 'how many takes?  that''s perfectly crisp.', '2006-02-09 07:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2136223, 292796, 14603, '<td valign="top">Very striking image.If this has been achieved without the aid of filters, it is remarkable indeed and worthy of a top finish...9</td>', 'Very striking image.If this has been achieved without the aid of filters, it is remarkable indeed and worthy of a top finish...9', '2006-02-09 07:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
