(2136719, 292016, 49867, '<td valign="top">I''m into hippies and India as much as the next guy (hell I live in China), and this pic would be great if the two hippies were in focus. Great idea for a pic, just not greatly executed. My guess is that because of the low light the shutter was open for long, the camera was being held so slight hand movements blurred the picture.</td>', 'I''m into hippies and India as much as the next guy (hell I live in China), and this pic would be great if the two hippies were in focus. Great idea for a pic, just not greatly executed. My guess is that because of the low light the shutter was open for long, the camera was being held so slight hand movements blurred the picture.', '2006-02-09 11:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
