(2141388, 291434, 50685, '<td valign="top">First off, I barely qualify as an amature.  But I am starting to realy enjoy this photo stuff.  I''m gonna give this a 9.  I suspect it is the perfect motion panning pic, but.  Could this have been done by using Macro at high shutter speed on a dart with a distant obscure background that is out of focus.  Maybe a differant background that showed the "panning" would have been better.  Just wondering as I am egar to learn.  Cool pic dude.</td>', 'First off, I barely qualify as an amature.  But I am starting to realy enjoy this photo stuff.  I''m gonna give this a 9.  I suspect it is the perfect motion panning pic, but.  Could this have been done by using Macro at high shutter speed on a dart with a distant obscure background that is out of focus.  Maybe a differant background that showed the "panning" would have been better.  Just wondering as I am egar to learn.  Cool pic dude.', '2006-02-10 21:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
