(2141715, 292796, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nicely done; has a really active, almost frenetic, feel to it.</td>', 'Nicely done; has a really active, almost frenetic, feel to it.', '2006-02-11 00:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141717, 291067, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice job! His expression and his movements work together to give an air of intensity, and you captured that well.</td>', 'Nice job! His expression and his movements work together to give an air of intensity, and you captured that well.', '2006-02-11 00:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141724, 290065, 47487, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you don''t need me to tell you that the concept of panning involves following a moving subject with the camera so that the background (and possibly the foreground) are blurred. This is a fun shot, but doesn''t fit this particular challenge. Also, just in general, I''d have cropped out the lighter area at the top of the photo; it''s a bit distracting.</td>', 'I''m sure you don''t need me to tell you that the concept of panning involves following a moving subject with the camera so that the background (and possibly the foreground) are blurred. This is a fun shot, but doesn''t fit this particular challenge. Also, just in general, I''d have cropped out the lighter area at the top of the photo; it''s a bit distracting.', '2006-02-11 00:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141728, 292764, 23002, '<td valign="top">Certainly lots of panning taking place here, however the low shutter speed needed to do it has caused too much of the bird to be out of focus as well.  nice effort though.</td>', 'Certainly lots of panning taking place here, however the low shutter speed needed to do it has caused too much of the bird to be out of focus as well.  nice effort though.', '2006-02-11 00:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141731, 290097, 23002, '<td valign="top">sorry, I fail to se how there is any motion panning in this shot.</td>', 'sorry, I fail to se how there is any motion panning in this shot.', '2006-02-11 00:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141732, 291453, 47487, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous motion shot. No panning, though. Panning involves a following a moving subject with the camera, so that the subject is sharp, and stationary objects are blurred. This shot (while very, very attractive, and probably a high scorer in a different challenge) has the opposite effect.</td>', 'Gorgeous motion shot. No panning, though. Panning involves a following a moving subject with the camera, so that the subject is sharp, and stationary objects are blurred. This shot (while very, very attractive, and probably a high scorer in a different challenge) has the opposite effect.', '2006-02-11 00:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141733, 290393, 23002, '<td valign="top">sorry, to abstract for me.</td>', 'sorry, to abstract for me.', '2006-02-11 00:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141734, 292403, 23002, '<td valign="top">Lots of motion blur, but nothing in sharp focus.</td>', 'Lots of motion blur, but nothing in sharp focus.', '2006-02-11 00:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141735, 290920, 47487, '<td valign="top">An evocative shot, but nothing in the image is sharp. Motion panning ideally causes one moving object to be sharp while surrounding objects are blurred.</td>', 'An evocative shot, but nothing in the image is sharp. Motion panning ideally causes one moving object to be sharp while surrounding objects are blurred.', '2006-02-11 00:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141736, 292224, 23002, '<td valign="top">Not quite crisp focus on the subjects, but great job of panning and great expressions.</td>', 'Not quite crisp focus on the subjects, but great job of panning and great expressions.', '2006-02-11 00:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141740, 290609, 23002, '<td valign="top">Nice just motion panning, just not an exciting subject.</td>', 'Nice just motion panning, just not an exciting subject.', '2006-02-11 00:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141744, 292764, 47487, '<td valign="top">Nice job. The bird''s body is nice and sharp, while his blurred wings and the blurred water show his movements. You know, I might have cropped out the land in this shot. But that''s probably just me.</td>', 'Nice job. The bird''s body is nice and sharp, while his blurred wings and the blurred water show his movements. You know, I might have cropped out the land in this shot. But that''s probably just me.', '2006-02-11 00:18:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2141745, 290604, 23002, '<td valign="top">If Duke''s head was not moving so much (and therefor blurry) it would be a winner.</td>', 'If Duke''s head was not moving so much (and therefor blurry) it would be a winner.', '2006-02-11 00:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
