(2141821, 292570, 47487, '<td valign="top">This is an odd kind of motion shot. The blur seems to be... not from motion? I don''t know. The mat is sharp, the gymnast is sharp, the girl in the background is relatively sharp, but there''s this blur going on, rather randomly when I really look. Is that a filter?</td>', 'This is an odd kind of motion shot. The blur seems to be... not from motion? I don''t know. The mat is sharp, the gymnast is sharp, the girl in the background is relatively sharp, but there''s this blur going on, rather randomly when I really look. Is that a filter?', '2006-02-11 00:31:16.000000', NULL, 1),
