(2142125, 292870, 44002, '<td valign="top">Well done obvious motion blur with the subject well focused</td>', 'Well done obvious motion blur with the subject well focused', '2006-02-11 05:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2142127, 292434, 43191, '<td valign="top">I think this is panning in reverse. The object you are shooting should be moving yet kept in focus by panning ( moving in the same direction ) your camera. WAIT! I think I can see what you''ve done. I think I can see movement ( motion blur ) in the car you have taken the shot from. So have you been driving past and managed to keep the tree in focus while moving? My first thought was that you were in a parked car and mearly captured the movement of the cars behind the tree. Hmm, now what score do I give you?? LOL Good luck with this one. : )</td>', 'I think this is panning in reverse. The object you are shooting should be moving yet kept in focus by panning ( moving in the same direction ) your camera. WAIT! I think I can see what you''ve done. I think I can see movement ( motion blur ) in the car you have taken the shot from. So have you been driving past and managed to keep the tree in focus while moving? My first thought was that you were in a parked car and mearly captured the movement of the cars behind the tree. Hmm, now what score do I give you?? LOL Good luck with this one. : )', '2006-02-11 05:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
