(2142255, 290580, 33515, '<td valign="top">The colors are very nice, the amount of blur is good as well. I might have cropped in a little more on the top and bottom just to keep the solid colors to a minimum but that''s me. Good Luck 9 Bump to 10 after further review, I really like this one.</td>', 'The colors are very nice, the amount of blur is good as well. I might have cropped in a little more on the top and bottom just to keep the solid colors to a minimum but that''s me. Good Luck 9 Bump to 10 after further review, I really like this one.', '2006-02-11 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
