(2145769, 291434, 75713, '<td valign="top">Best panning shot in the competition hands down no questions asked....but...if I was to ask a question I would want to know how you accomplished this brilliantly focused shot...colors are beautiful</td>', 'Best panning shot in the competition hands down no questions asked....but...if I was to ask a question I would want to know how you accomplished this brilliantly focused shot...colors are beautiful', '2006-02-12 23:36:53.000000', NULL, 1),
