(2148987, 291434, 43191, '<td valign="top">Not sure how to vote on this one. Doesn''t look like a panned shot, the dart is way too clear and the background out of focus. Love the shot, just not convinced it is a true panned shot. If this is panned it is truely outstanding. I don''t want to mark you low on something I''m not sure about, I''ll compromise and give you a 7. Good luck!</td>', 'Not sure how to vote on this one. Doesn''t look like a panned shot, the dart is way too clear and the background out of focus. Love the shot, just not convinced it is a true panned shot. If this is panned it is truely outstanding. I don''t want to mark you low on something I''m not sure about, I''ll compromise and give you a 7. Good luck!', '2006-02-14 00:16:12.000000', NULL, 1),
