(2149305, 292240, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice try, but i think it needs work.  you need to push it just a bit further.  a bit slower shutter and a bit more blur, and i think you''ll have.  great subject to be shooting.  you might also want to get a little sharper focus (i know it''s tough, but what isn''t?).</td>', 'nice try, but i think it needs work.  you need to push it just a bit further.  a bit slower shutter and a bit more blur, and i think you''ll have.  great subject to be shooting.  you might also want to get a little sharper focus (i know it''s tough, but what isn''t?).', '2006-02-14 05:48:46.000000', NULL, 1),
