(2149316, 292498, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m sure he''s full of energy.  too bad you didn''t get a shot of him running around the room, rather than towards you...</td>', 'i''m sure he''s full of energy.  too bad you didn''t get a shot of him running around the room, rather than towards you...', '2006-02-14 05:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149317, 292536, 23394, '<td valign="top">no clue about this one.  pardon my ignorance.</td>', 'no clue about this one.  pardon my ignorance.', '2006-02-14 05:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149319, 291951, 23394, '<td valign="top">sorry, but your shutter was a bit to quick.  except for the slight blur of the tire, this car would be sitting still.  you may have achieved something that meets the challenge, but, all the same, it doesn''t really grab me.</td>', 'sorry, but your shutter was a bit to quick.  except for the slight blur of the tire, this car would be sitting still.  you may have achieved something that meets the challenge, but, all the same, it doesn''t really grab me.', '2006-02-14 05:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149322, 292426, 23394, '<td valign="top">wow.  this could have been great.  cute subject, something with controllable motion, interesting angle.  you should have worked at it a bit more, from slightly different angles and with slightly slower shutter speeds.  as is, the tip of the shoe being in focus says you were on the right track, but not quite getting there.</td>', 'wow.  this could have been great.  cute subject, something with controllable motion, interesting angle.  you should have worked at it a bit more, from slightly different angles and with slightly slower shutter speeds.  as is, the tip of the shoe being in focus says you were on the right track, but not quite getting there.', '2006-02-14 05:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149323, 292628, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice idea, but you gave up too soon.  just not enough synchronization with the subject to really nail it.</td>', 'nice idea, but you gave up too soon.  just not enough synchronization with the subject to really nail it.', '2006-02-14 06:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149326, 290432, 43405, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. But the panning aspect of the challenge is not present in the photograph.</td>', 'Nice composition. But the panning aspect of the challenge is not present in the photograph.', '2006-02-14 06:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149329, 291434, 23394, '<td valign="top">my personal opinion?  it''s too perfect of a shot, especially from a technical standpoint.  without any blur or context from the background, it feels as sterile as something that comes from a lab.</td>', 'my personal opinion?  it''s too perfect of a shot, especially from a technical standpoint.  without any blur or context from the background, it feels as sterile as something that comes from a lab.', '2006-02-14 06:03:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149330, 292322, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract, but not giving me any sense of motion panning.</td>', 'interesting abstract, but not giving me any sense of motion panning.', '2006-02-14 06:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149333, 292727, 23394, '<td valign="top">yes, she''s in motion, but if you look at the rest of the entries, you''ll get a better idea as to how you could have taken this subject and opportunity and done much better with a different composition.  the idea was for the camera to be moving in order to capture something in motion--and the more movement, the better.  her, your shutter and flash combination worked more to freeze the action than to follow it.</td>', 'yes, she''s in motion, but if you look at the rest of the entries, you''ll get a better idea as to how you could have taken this subject and opportunity and done much better with a different composition.  the idea was for the camera to be moving in order to capture something in motion--and the more movement, the better.  her, your shutter and flash combination worked more to freeze the action than to follow it.', '2006-02-14 06:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149336, 291376, 23394, '<td valign="top">motion panning?  if you say so...<br/>looks more like a motion blur to me, though</td>', 'motion panning?  if you say so...looks more like a motion blur to me, though', '2006-02-14 06:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149337, 292568, 23394, '<td valign="top">i imagine something is in motion, but the image gives me no clue as to what is going on</td>', 'i imagine something is in motion, but the image gives me no clue as to what is going on', '2006-02-14 06:09:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149342, 292756, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is the type of entry that blows my mind.  sorry if you find this offensive, but really.  you have a decent camera.  i have to assume you went out to shoot for the challenge.  this was the best you could do?  you were on the right track...why''d you quit?  why didn''t you look for a car with color that wouldn''t blend into the background?  why didn''t you try to find a background that would offer interesting colors when blurred together?  this one looks like it was a shot that ''got away'', but you decided to go with it anyways.  motion panning shots are fun and can be interesting, but they do take practice; the thing is, practice doesn''t cost anything but time.  oh well.</td>', 'this is the type of entry that blows my mind.  sorry if you find this offensive, but really.  you have a decent camera.  i have to assume you went out to shoot for the challenge.  this was the best you could do?  you were on the right track...why''d you quit?  why didn''t you look for a car with color that wouldn''t blend into the background?  why didn''t you try to find a background that would offer interesting colors when blurred together?  this one looks like it was a shot that ''got away'', but you decided to go with it anyways.  motion panning shots are fun and can be interesting, but they do take practice; the thing is, practice doesn''t cost anything but time.  oh well.', '2006-02-14 06:17:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149345, 292512, 23394, '<td valign="top">this looks cool, but for me, it''s done in by the background--just not enough blur.  your background has so much sameness to it, that without the absense of some blur on the wheels, it almost looks like the car is parked...</td>', 'this looks cool, but for me, it''s done in by the background--just not enough blur.  your background has so much sameness to it, that without the absense of some blur on the wheels, it almost looks like the car is parked...', '2006-02-14 06:19:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149349, 292434, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think you missed the point of the challenge...</td>', 'i think you missed the point of the challenge...', '2006-02-14 06:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2149350, 292040, 23394, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract, yes.  capturing a subject in motion?  can''t really see that here.</td>', 'interesting abstract, yes.  capturing a subject in motion?  can''t really see that here.', '2006-02-14 06:20:27.000000', NULL, 1),
