(2150562, 292264, 40819, '<td valign="top">After seeing all the others I have come to see this is an excellent shot compared to all of them, meets the requirements and is such a colorful image it has to be boosted up a few. Great job.</td>', 'After seeing all the others I have come to see this is an excellent shot compared to all of them, meets the requirements and is such a colorful image it has to be boosted up a few. Great job.', '2006-02-14 18:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150563, 291882, 40819, '<td valign="top">The reason I think there are so many NYC taxis in these challenges is they are always moving so fast you have to pan to get a shot of them. Good job.</td>', 'The reason I think there are so many NYC taxis in these challenges is they are always moving so fast you have to pan to get a shot of them. Good job.', '2006-02-14 18:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2150564, 292824, 40819, '<td valign="top">You are almost there with this shot, I like the way the DOF is so shallow but at the angle of this shot there is not enough in focus to draw the eye to it. Good effort though.</td>', 'You are almost there with this shot, I like the way the DOF is so shallow but at the angle of this shot there is not enough in focus to draw the eye to it. Good effort though.', '2006-02-14 18:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
