(2150569, 291606, 40819, '<td valign="top">I like this image for two reasons, the warmth of the colors and the shallow DOF, is it really moving? That I can''t tell but this is an excellent image.</td>', 'I like this image for two reasons, the warmth of the colors and the shallow DOF, is it really moving? That I can''t tell but this is an excellent image.', '2006-02-14 18:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
