(2151345, 291066, 3569, '<td valign="top">I knew it wouldn''t get above a 4, but I accomplished what I wanted with the shot.  Try shooting a football, getting it in the frame, in a gym, at 30ft using a 300mm with 2x converter and get something with it.  That''s what this shot shows, high motion blur and speed stopping most of the strings.  Thanks for the comments.  Van<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-15 07:13:57.</i></td>', 'I knew it wouldn''t get above a 4, but I accomplished what I wanted with the shot.  Try shooting a football, getting it in the frame, in a gym, at 30ft using a 300mm with 2x converter and get something with it.  That''s what this shot shows, high motion blur and speed stopping most of the strings.  Thanks for the comments.  Van', '2006-02-15 00:14:55.000000', '2006-02-15 07:13:57.000000', 0),
