(2151842, 292854, 1647, '<td valign="top">I got to vote on this challenge but run out of time to place comments...  I was going to leave you a comment though about this image.  Personally, it was #1 in the challenge.  A great idea executed to perfection.  In particular the hair flowing in the breeze helps confirm the motion, and the colours are lovely and rich.  Of course it helps that the girl / lady in the photo has a natural beauty about her.  In a word... Stunning.</td>', 'I got to vote on this challenge but run out of time to place comments...  I was going to leave you a comment though about this image.  Personally, it was #1 in the challenge.  A great idea executed to perfection.  In particular the hair flowing in the breeze helps confirm the motion, and the colours are lovely and rich.  Of course it helps that the girl / lady in the photo has a natural beauty about her.  In a word... Stunning.', '2006-02-15 01:40:34.000000', NULL, 0),
