(2152519, 291434, 47106, '<td valign="top">Ok... I will explain it to all those ubelievers over there. It actually IS motion panning, but if you could think a bit you would realise that you don''t have to throw the dart.. The dart was falling vertically, my friend was dropping it and the background is a MAP... about 100photos. 1 chosen. Big thanks for the BELIEVERS :)This isn''t about cheatin!!</td>', 'Ok... I will explain it to all those ubelievers over there. It actually IS motion panning, but if you could think a bit you would realise that you don''t have to throw the dart.. The dart was falling vertically, my friend was dropping it and the background is a MAP... about 100photos. 1 chosen. Big thanks for the BELIEVERS :)This isn''t about cheatin!!', '2006-02-15 06:08:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(2152541, 292034, 52472, '<td valign="top">For those who thought it was no panning, I can assure them it was. But now I can see it was a bad idea to try to take this picture against the light. The  front of the train, which is the sharp bit of the picture gets to dark and the effect is lost. Also, I could not work with low enough shutter speeds because I had no ND filters...</td>', 'For those who thought it was no panning, I can assure them it was. But now I can see it was a bad idea to try to take this picture against the light. The  front of the train, which is the sharp bit of the picture gets to dark and the effect is lost. Also, I could not work with low enough shutter speeds because I had no ND filters...', '2006-02-15 06:26:32.000000', NULL, 0),
