(2155241, 292134, 50685, '<td valign="top">I can''t belive I did this well.  I''m learning a lot here at DPC.  After submitting I discovered the rule of thirds and did a much better job of cropping.  Also ventured into Photoshop and used Auto Levels, contrast and color.  This improved the shot very much.  Thanks for all the advice. <a href="//public.fotki.com/bridog/contest/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Link</a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-02-15 22:41:55.</i></td>', 'I can''t belive I did this well.  I''m learning a lot here at DPC.  After submitting I discovered the rule of thirds and did a much better job of cropping.  Also ventured into Photoshop and used Auto Levels, contrast and color.  This improved the shot very much.  Thanks for all the advice. Link', '2006-02-15 20:28:51.000000', '2006-02-15 22:41:55.000000', 0),
