(3209112, 292854, 19708, '<td valign="top">I''ve admired this shot for a long time now, and just noticed it wasn''t in my favorites, nor had I commented on it.<br/><i>(hides in embarrassment)</i> <br/> <br/>This is one of those shots that just brings a smile to my face and melts away the problems of the day.<br/>There''s such a carefree, feel-good sensation that comes from just absorbing the mood in it.<br/>Great stuff Ursula!</td>', 'I''ve admired this shot for a long time now, and just noticed it wasn''t in my favorites, nor had I commented on it.(hides in embarrassment)  This is one of those shots that just brings a smile to my face and melts away the problems of the day.There''s such a carefree, feel-good sensation that comes from just absorbing the mood in it.Great stuff Ursula!', '2007-01-10 20:33:02.000000', NULL, 0),
